# Cursor rules for this repo

- Playwright + TypeScript. POM in `pages/`, tests in `tests/`.
- Locators: `[data-test=...]` and roles, not nth-child chains.
- No `waitForTimeout`. No skipping tests to “make CI green” without documenting why.
- API client: `tests/api/booking.client.ts`. Auth header is Cookie `token=...` (not Bearer).
- Restful Booker DELETE success is often **201**, not 204.
- Sauce Demo cart rows are `.cart_item`, not `[data-test="inventory-item"]`.
- Write Ukrainian or English comments only when they explain a non-obvious contract quirk.
